[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_guyid")
grade = 4
sprite = ExtResource("2_ufy4t")
description = "Moai Fish are typically found near volcanoes. They have almost human faces with stoic, unchanging expressions. Because they're filter feeders and their stony skin are a deterrent to most predators, Moai Fish are rather peaceful creatures.

Evidence suggests that the Moai Fish have existed for 11000 years. The face of the Moai fish is a topic of furious debate. Ancient Pwaaga once thought these fish were craved by their deity \"Alcedo Atthis\" and shaped in its image, but Pwaaga pilgrims eventually popularized a different idea. They believed that Moai Fish bore the face of their ancestors and that they would watch over them though the Fish. In modern times they have lost most of their spiritual significance and are just considered funny looking. Even still, some people will reserve food for the Moai Fish, and talk to them as if they can understand. No one can deny, there's something alive behind that stony expression.
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cr3nmjdvpgh0a"
